'''Voluptuous Peony - Daji''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 741
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Voluptuous Peony - Daji
|name2 = Daji & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Daji & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Daji is a simple unit, she stays in the back and, if well protected, she will sometimes land a powerful attack that will heavily cripple any Angel or Floating enemy caught in the blast, all while dealing acceptable damage to other enemies. In addition to her Massive damage ability, Daji also has a brief, yet guaranteed Slow effect that can help meatshields push further into the enemy frontlines after she attacks. All in all, while she isn't an especially outstanding unit stat-wise, she can still serve a perfectly good performance in almost any general or anti-Floating/Angel lineup.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Backliner}}

